---
// Політика конфіденційності (GDPR). Строки зберігання збігаються з public.cleanup_personal_data()
// у supabase/migrations/20261101000006_retention.sql — міняти разом.
import LegalDoc from '../../components/legal/LegalDoc.astro';
import Seller from '../../components/legal/Seller.astro';
import { LOCALES, type Locale } from '../../i18n/config';
import { href } from '../../lib/format';

export function getStaticPaths() {
  return LOCALES.map((lang) => ({ params: { lang } }));
}
const locale = Astro.params.lang as Locale;
---
<LegalDoc locale={locale} titleKey="footer.privacy" heading="Privacy Policy">
  <h2>1. Who is responsible for your data</h2>
  <p>The controller of your personal data is the seller who runs the ABAWKA shop:</p>
  <Seller />
  <p>For any question about your data, write to the email above.</p>

  <h2>2. What data we collect</h2>
  <p>When you send a request from the cart or a product page:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>your name, your contact (phone number, messenger username or email) and the preferred way to contact you;</li>
    <li>your country, the preferred delivery method and your comment, if you write one;</li>
    <li>the products and quantities you chose and the language of the website;</li>
    <li>your IP address — only to protect the form from spam (limit on the number of requests).</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Later, while arranging the purchase, you may give the seller your delivery address and payment details directly by phone or message. They are used only to complete your purchase.</p>
  <p>Your cart and display settings (theme, currency) are kept only in your browser (local storage) and are not sent to us. We do not use cookies for tracking, analytics or advertising.</p>

  <h2>3. Why we use it and on what legal basis</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To answer your request, agree the purchase and deliver it — steps taken at your request before and under a contract (Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR).</li>
    <li>To keep the records required by tax law for completed purchases (Art. 6(1)(c) GDPR).</li>
    <li>To protect the website from spam and abuse and to handle possible claims — our legitimate interest (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR).</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Giving your data is voluntary, but without a name and a contact we cannot answer your request. We do not make automated decisions or profile you.</p>

  <h2>4. Who else receives your data</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><b>Supabase</b> — stores the requests in a database on servers in the European Union (Ireland).</li>
    <li><b>Netlify</b> — hosts the website and may see your IP address in technical logs.</li>
    <li><b>Telegram</b> — a new request is sent as a notification to the seller's Telegram account. Telegram may process data outside the European Economic Area.</li>
    <li><b>Delivery companies</b> — receive the name, address and phone number needed to deliver your parcel.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>When the data is processed outside the European Economic Area, this is done under the safeguards required by the GDPR, such as the European Commission's standard contractual clauses. If you choose to talk to the seller in a messenger (Telegram, Viber, WhatsApp), that service's own privacy policy also applies.</p>

  <h2>5. How long we keep it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>IP address — 30 days.</li>
    <li>Requests that did not lead to a purchase — 12 months.</li>
    <li>Completed purchases — 5 years from the end of the year of the purchase, as required by tax law.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>After that, the data is deleted automatically.</p>

  <h2>6. Your rights</h2>
  <p>You have the right to access your data, correct it, have it deleted, restrict its use, receive it in a portable format and object to its use based on our legitimate interest. To use any of these rights, write to the seller; we reply within one month.</p>
  <p>You also have the right to lodge a complaint with a data protection authority. In Poland this is the President of the Personal Data Protection Office (Prezes Urzędu Ochrony Danych Osobowych, ul. Stawki 2, 00-193 Warszawa); you can also contact the authority in your own country.</p>

  <h2>7. Children</h2>
  <p>Requests should be sent by adults. If you are under 16, please ask a parent or guardian to send the request for you.</p>

  <h2>8. Changes</h2>
  <p>If this policy changes, the new version will be published on this page with a new date. See also the <a href={href(locale, 'terms/')}>Terms of Sale</a>.</p>
</LegalDoc>
